      "body": "Third quarter 2026 results: EPS: ₹35.76 (up from ₹22.13 in 3Q 2025). Revenue: ₹1.16b (up 22% from 3Q 2025). Net income: ₹172.8m (up 66% from 3Q 2025). Profit margin: 15% (up from 11% in 3Q 2025). The increase in margin was driven by higher revenue. Over the last 3 years on average, earnings per share has increased by 22% per year but the company’s share price has increased by 66% per year, which means it is tracking significantly ahead of earnings growth.",
